#: data/maps/FortreeCity_Mart/scripts.inc:40
msgctxt "FortreeCity_Mart_Text_SuperRepelBetter"
msgid ""
"SUPER REPEL lasts a long time,\n"
"and it gets the job done.\p"
"It's much better than an ordinary\n"
"REPEL.$"
msgstr ""
"白银喷雾效果持续时间长，而且很管用。\p"
"比普通的除虫喷雾好多了。$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_Mart/scripts.inc:46
msgctxt "FortreeCity_Mart_Text_StockUpOnItems"
msgid ""
"I always stock up on more items than\n"
"I'm sure I'll need.\p"
"You never know what might happen.\n"
"Better to be safe than sorry!$"
msgstr ""
"我总是会多买一些道具，\n"
"比我觉得需要的还多。\p"
"谁也不知道会发生什么嘛。\n"
"有备无患才好！$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_Mart/scripts.inc:52
msgctxt "FortreeCity_Mart_Text_RareCandyMakesMonGrow"
msgid ""
"A RARE CANDY makes a POKéMON grow\n"
"immediately by one level.$"
msgstr "神奇糖果能让宝可梦马上提升1级。$"
